[h1]Wave of Darkness Patch 1.65[/h1]

Hi all!

The new patch is out and it brings the following:

[list]
[*]Added location tags for each teleport on the map;
[*]Fixed problem with double teleport icon rendering in maps panel;
[*]When the last quest is finished in the Tutorial area of the game, the tooltip near the docks changes to "The tutorial is now over";
[*]Hungarian localization updated;
[/list]


As usual, please give us your feedback regarding the patches in the [url=http://steamcommunity.com/app/316370/discussions/0/598198356164874999/]Patches thread[/url], as well as your [url=http://steamcommunity.com/app/316370/discussions/0/598198173699356534/]Suggestions[/url] and [url=http://steamcommunity.com/app/316370/discussions/0/598198173699343906/]Bug and Crash reports[/url]!

Thank you!

Your,
Dreamatrix Team

