Wave of Darkness Patch 1.42

We made it easier for player to identify and de-curse items:

Scroll of Veles' Wisdom - identifies all the items, and finds the cursed item, but it doesn't remove the curse from the item;
Scroll of Veles' Glory - identifies only the cursed items and removes the curse;
Scroll of Veles' Peace - identifies only the items cursed by Marowit and removes its curse;
Scroll of Veles' Life - identifies only the items cursed by Flins and removes its curse;
Scroll of Veles' Compassion - identifies only the items cursed by Berstuk and removes its curse;
Scroll of Veles' Faith - identifies only the items cursed by Zirnitra and removes its curse;
Scroll of Veles' Understanding - identifies only the items cursed by Triglav and removes its curse;
Scroll of Veles' Ascension - identifies only the items cursed by Morana and removes its curse.

Also, we saw your complaints regarding the disappearing consumable recipes. This is now fixed, so the recipes do not disappear when you craft usable items, like potions, food, scrolls, etc.

